### Registrar un usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "david",
    "password": "skibidi"
}

### Hacer Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "david",
    "password": "skibidi"
}

### Login con contraseña incorrecta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "david",
    "password": "toilet"
}